      ],
      "source": "https://duncansvillepa.gov/history/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Duncansville sits along the historic Philadelphia‑Pittsburgh Turnpike, a route that once ferried travelers between the two cities.",
